      <svg:desc>Graphical user interface, application

Description automatically generated</svg:desc>
     </draw:frame></text:p>
    <text:list xml:id="list150818896344811" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum32">
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P127">If the build succeeds, you’ll see a message in the Job Manager panel with what you’ve built (<text:span text:style-name="T179">time_demux</text:span>, in this case) highlighted in green.</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
    </text:list>
   </text:section>
   <text:p text:style-name="P14">To build the worker w<text:span text:style-name="T141">ith </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Code">ocpidev</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T141">, run the following command from the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Code">DemoProject</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Code"><text:span text:style-name="T84">5</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T141"> directory:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Code"><text:span text:style-name="Default_20_Paragraph_20_Font"><draw:frame text:anchor-type="as-char" draw:z-index="8" draw:name="Shape11" draw:style-name="gr9" draw:text-style-name="P200" svg:width="6.3961in" svg:height="0.2531in">
      <draw:text-box>
       <text:p><text:span text:style-name="T214">ocpidev build worker time_demux.rcc --rcc-platform centos7</text:span></text:p>
      </draw:text-box>
     </draw:frame></text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P91" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2353_3952663903"/>Create <text:span text:style-name="T211">Unit</text:span> Test<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2353_3952663903"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P44">Like we did in Tutorial<text:span text:style-name="T199">s</text:span> 3 <text:span text:style-name="T84">and 4</text:span>, we’ll generate an OpenCPI test suite <text:span text:style-name="T208">(aka “unit test”)</text:span> for our <text:span text:style-name="T84">time demux</text:span> worker.</text:p>
   <text:section text:style-name="Sect2" text:name="Section2" text:condition="ooow:AVGUI LEQ 1" text:display="condition">
    <text:p text:style-name="P42"><text:span text:style-name="T92">To create the unit test for the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Code"><text:span text:style-name="T68">time</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Code">_</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Code"><text:span text:style-name="T84">demux</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T93"> worker with the OpenCPI GUI:</text:span></text:p>
    <text:list xml:id="list150818702438143" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum32">
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P128">From the GUI menu bar at the top of the window, select <text:span text:style-name="T27">Create</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T76"> &gt; </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T27">Component Test Suite…</text:span></text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P129"><text:span text:style-name="T76">In the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T27">Associated Project</text:span> drop-down list, select <text:span text:style-name="T27">DemoProject5</text:span>.</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P130"><text:span text:style-name="T212">In the Component Spec drop-down list, select </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">time_demux</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Default_20_Paragraph_20_Font"><text:span text:style-name="T83">.</text:span></text:span></text:p>
     </text:list-item>
    </text:list>
    <text:p text:style-name="Diagram"><text:span text:style-name="Default_20_Paragraph_20_Font"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image16" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="3.0417in" svg:height="2.0154in" draw:z-index="25"><draw:image>
